  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Thousand Transformations Ancestor sends two rank seven female immortals to investigate after his will, Mutation Immortal Gu, and Dancer Hong Yun are trapped. Narration names them Night Temptress and Immortal Concubine Qing Lan. Against the dream realm they are helpless until a mysterious sound path voice tips them toward Fairy Cui Bo.",
      "chapters": [
        1422
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor",
        "gu_mutation_immortal_gu",
        "char_dancer_hong_yun",
        "char_fairy_cui_bo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She and Night Temptress fly around a conspicuous red dream realm and set Gu worms to form an immortal Gu formation that seals it. Their roles split cleanly: Night Temptress defends while Immortal Concubine Qing Lan finishes the final steps and seats the formation core. Among the concubines, Night Temptress has the highest status and strength, and Immortal Concubine Qing Lan is second. She takes out rank seven rule path Immortal Gu Pass as the formation core. After the light yellow cloud forms, both sigh in relief and say they can return almost instantly.",
      "chapters": [
        1423
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "gu_pass_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Related peer detail sits on Night Temptress.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_night_temptress"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She maintains the light yellow immortal formation covering the dream realm. Narration restates her rank seven cultivation and status as a concubine of Thousand Transformations Ancestor. Called a famous Western Desert beauty, she chooses to defend rather than attack, sends an urgent message for help, and holds the yellow cloud under Myriad Year Flying Warship’s rain of silver flying swords. She notes the formation was reinforced to rank eight. When Night Temptress and other concubines teleport in, she asks where husband is. Night Temptress says it is not time yet for him to move. Another female immortal calls her Qing Lan. When a disguised Thousand Transformations Ancestor reveals himself, she and Night Temptress shout husband in surprise and joy.",
      "chapters": [
        1872
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "holding-against-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration states Thousand Transformations Ancestor had no choice but to send Night Temptress and Immortal Concubine Qing Lan to construct a rank seven immortal formation around the dream realm, and that this action exposed his state to Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        1873
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "exposure-to-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration recalls that when Night Temptress and Immortal Concubine Qing Lan first set an immortal formation, rank seven rule path Immortal Gu Pass was its core.",
      "chapters": [
        1877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pass-gu-recalled",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
